Z||000024||Archie||05-29-2001||12:31 AM||||Boy you guys are getting eLaine all worked up. He sent me a nasty-gram.... it seems he thinks the mirror mounting idea (to the door) was his idea. I didn't answer his EMail, I don't really care who's idea it is. I know I've been doing it since I built my 1st F-40 in 1989. But I think someone else told me about it. Either way it predates CK3.<P>Boy, I love it when the Jerk-offs in the industry HATE me.<P>I wish these guys would join the forum, so we can benifit from their superior knowledge firsthand.<P>Archie||||reg||7
Z||000025||Songman||05-29-2001||12:47 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by TRiAD:<BR><B>Songman, sorry, I hope you don't think I burned you withg them there. Fact is, if they are this way, it's better we avoid them anyway, and if seeing this would make them better, then we all benefit, right?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Nah.. I ain't worried about them. I was just ribbin you a little... I won't say anything that I would be afraid for anyone to see..<P>Like everone else, I did think his answer was a little 'blowy'... I already know what kit I will be building when the funds are available... I'm gonna use that guy that Blaine is worried about enough to mention his name in there... what is it? ARCHIE! hehe<BR>I'll be driving a Finale one of these days!<P><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||10
